<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">1</span><h2>About the service</h2></div>
    <p class="lead">Regular vertical content for Instagram and TikTok. One shoot day, then a batch of short clips in editing: steady output, without filming every week.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">2</span><h2>Formats</h2></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch">
          <div><div class="cname">One-off shoot day</div><div class="tg">Try it out</div></div>
          <span class="csum">from 350 €</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>One shoot day, up to 4 hours</li>
          <li>8–12 vertical clips in editing</li>
          <li>Subtitles, music, simple graphics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch">
          <div><div class="cname">Monthly · Start</div><div class="tg">Consistency</div></div>
          <span class="csum">from 450 € / mo</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>1 shoot day per month</li>
          <li>8–10 clips, basic editing</li>
          <li>Subtitles, music, 1 round of revisions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ch">
          <div><div class="cname">Monthly · Active</div><div class="tg">More volume</div></div>
          <span class="csum">from 750 € / mo</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>2 shoot days per month</li>
          <li>14–16 clips, cover frames</li>
          <li>Trend-driven work, priority on timing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="lead" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;">The packages are indicative: the exact volume and rhythm are tailored to your goal. They are built on the same rate as filming, just arranged into a convenient monthly format.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">3</span><h2>What's included</h2></div>
    <ul class="notes">
      <li><b>Filming.</b> Vertical filming on a camera or phone, depending on the goal and the style.</li>
      <li><b>Editing.</b> 9:16 format, subtitles, music, simple graphics and pacing for the feed.</li>
      <li><b>Ideas.</b> I help with ideas and short clip scripts and suggest what is working right now.</li>
      <li><b>Posting.</b> I hand over finished clips, you post them yourselves. Full account management can be discussed separately.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">4</span><h2>Terms</h2></div>
    <ul class="cond">
      <li><b>Prices are final,</b> PVN is not added.</li>
      <li><b>Monthly format.</b> This makes it easy to plan and keep clips coming out regularly.</li>
      <li><b>Payment.</b> Monthly in advance. One-off day: 30 % deposit, the rest on the shoot day.</li>
      <li><b>Shoot day.</b> Up to 4 hours, usually at one or two locations.</li>
      <li><b>Travel.</b> Riga included. Further out by distance, as in the other services.</li>
      <li><b>Revisions.</b> 1 round per batch of clips.</li>
      <li><b>Pause.</b> The monthly format can be paused or cancelled with a week's notice.</li>
      <li><b>Offer valid for:</b> 30 days.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="close">
  <div class="col">
    <p class="cta">Tell me about the profile and what we are making content for, and I will suggest a suitable package.</p>
    <div class="contacts">
      <div class="who">Andrey <span>· Flora Creative Studio</span></div>
      <div>Call or WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+37127775842">+371 27 775 842</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



